  "unit_note": "USD millions. GPO Business Operations Revolving Fund (id 004-4505-0-4-808), Program and Financing schedule, PDF page 27 (printed page 39) right column. Unit 1 of the 2-unit by-schedule split of this 152-cell account (sibling: -gpo-business-operations-objclass), following the GAO 005-0107 by-schedule precedent; each schedule prints its own 004-4505 header. Revolving fund: mandatory offsetting-collections spending authority (1800/1801/1850), uncollected-payments tracking (3060/3070/3090), and a mandatory net section (4090-4170). Row 4160 Budget authority, net (mandatory) prints dotted-leader blank in ALL three columns (4090+4130+4140 nets to zero, zero-suppressed) and is omitted per convention (blank != zero) - consequently 4090/4140 feed no encodable relation and 4180 is single-source. Blank cells: 1012 col 1 only, 4010 blank col 1, 4123 blank col 1. Negatives as printed (1801 c1, 3020, 3060, 3090, 4120, 4123, 4130, 4140 c2/c3, 3070 c2/c3). 1930 sums 1000+1900 directly in c2/c3 (1070 single-source there) per family precedent. Obligated-balance memo lines 3100/3200 are genuine sums (uncollected payments present). Cross-schedule sanity (not encoded; sibling re-reads independently): 0900 = 99.9 (1302/1294/1294).",
